#: ../../how-to/qos-management.md:56
msgid "异步链路默认无限重传, 同步链路可设置 `max_retransmit` 限制。"
msgstr "Asynchronous links allow unlimited retransmissions by default; synchronous links can set a `max_retransmit` limit."

#: ../../how-to/qos-management.md:65
msgid "HARQ 反馈"
msgstr "HARQ Feedback"

#: ../../how-to/qos-management.md:67
msgid "`HarqController` 支持两种反馈模式:"
msgstr "`HarqController` supports two feedback modes:"

#: ../../how-to/qos-management.md:69
msgid "**TB 模式**: 整个传输块 ACK/NACK, `harq_feedback` 字段为期望 SN"
msgstr "**TB mode**: ACK/NACK for the entire transport block; the `harq_feedback` field is the expected SN"

#: ../../how-to/qos-management.md:70
msgid "**CBG 模式**: 按编码块组反馈, `harq_feedback` 每 bit 对应一个 CBG"
msgstr "**CBG mode**: Feedback per code block group; each bit in `harq_feedback` corresponds to one CBG"

#: ../../how-to/qos-management.md:79
msgid "链路质量跟踪与 AMC"
msgstr "Link Quality Tracking and AMC"

#: ../../how-to/qos-management.md:81
msgid "`LinkQualityTracker` 通过滑动窗口统计 FER, 建议 MCS 调整:"
msgstr "`LinkQualityTracker` tracks FER using a sliding window and recommends MCS adjustments:"

#: ../../how-to/qos-management.md:90
msgid "流控"
msgstr "Flow Control"

#: ../../how-to/qos-management.md:92
msgid "`FlowController` 基于高/低水位机制实现背压:"
msgstr "`FlowController` implements backpressure based on high/low watermark thresholds:"

